## What Happens After You're Listed?

Getting listed on Google Maps is the first step. Ranking in the top three results — the Local Pack — requires ongoing [local SEO](/services/local-seo-google-ranking/) work: consistent citations, regular review generation, on-page website optimisation, and content that signals to Google where you are and what you do.

